{"id":"kazan","name":"喀山","en":"Kazan","country":"Russia","lat":55.7908,"lng":49.1144,"dek":"伏尔加河畔，两种信仰与两种语言并存的城市。","history":"喀山的建城时间长期存在争议。一方认为它由伏尔加保加利亚人在11世纪至13世纪之间创立，作为与芬兰人部落的边界站；另一方则认为它是15世纪中期金帐汗国时期的鞑靼人所建。考古学在现代城市境内找到了三处有证据表明的城市定居点，最古老的村庄可能是建于11世纪的喀山克里姆林宫。1223年，哲别和速不台的军队劫掠了保加尔地区，许多难民逃至喀山。1438年金帐汗国衰败后，喀山成为强大的喀山汗国的首都，城市中的巴扎成为重要的商业中心。\n\n1552年，伊凡四世亲征，在围困战后攻占喀山，大量人口遭到屠杀。大多数鞑靼居民被强迫转信东正教或被杀戮，清真寺与宫殿遭到破坏，剩余的鞑靼人口被强制迁移至城外。1579年一场大火后，城市中发现了俄罗斯正教极为尊崇的喀山圣母像。1708年喀山成为喀山省的中心。彼得一世视察后，这里成为里海舰队的造船中心。1774年，普加乔夫起义军占领并摧毁了城市，叶卡捷琳娜大帝随后下令重建，并允许重建清真寺，马儿卡尼清真寺是第一个。19世纪初，亚历山大一世建立了喀山大学，使其成为俄罗斯东方学研究中心。1801年，古兰经首次在喀山印刷。\n\n1917年十月革命期间，喀山也是一个中心，曾短暂成为阿的里-乌拉尔国首都，1918年被布尔什维克政府击溃。俄国内战基本结束后，1920年喀山成为鞑靼苏维埃社会主义自治共和国的首府。苏德战争时期，由于西部工业东迁，喀山成为生产飞机和坦克的国防工业中心。1979年城市人口达到一百万。1991年苏联解体后，喀山重新成为鞑靼文化中心。2005年，喀山庆祝了建城千禧年，历史委员会官方认定1005年为建城年，耗资巨大的库尔沙里夫清真寺于当年在克里姆林宫内完工。","culture":"喀山城市人口几乎由俄罗斯人（48.8%）和鞑靼人（47.5%）构成，主要宗教为逊尼派伊斯兰教和东方正教会。两种宗教与两种语言在此地长期共存，鞑靼语和俄语是街头最常听见的语言。城市在1905年俄国革命后曾一度被视为鞑靼文化中心，第一家鞑靼剧场和第一份鞑靼报纸随之出现。\n\n这座城市与多位文化人物有关。诗人加甫里尔·杰尔查文1743年出生于此，歌唱家夏里亚宾1873年在此出生。作家列夫·托尔斯泰9岁时举家迁往喀山，后就读于喀山国立大学，革命家列宁也曾在该校就读。建于1804年的喀山联邦大学是俄罗斯第三古老的大学。喀山最著名的剧院是穆萨·贾利勒国家模范剧院，从1982年起成为夏里亚宾国际歌剧节的举办地。","pull":"一种城市，两座钟声：东正教堂与清真寺隔墙相望。","sights":[{"name":"喀山克里姆林宫","orig":"Казанский кремль","intro":"伊凡雷帝摧毁鞑靼要塞后，在16世纪按俄罗斯风格重建的建筑群，列入世界遗产。内部既有东正教报喜大教堂，也有2005年落成的库尔沙里夫清真寺。从克里姆林宫街顶端的白色钟楼斯帕斯塔进入，中央大道两侧依次排列各主要建筑。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8C._%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D1%81_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B0_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F.jpg/960px-%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D1%8C._%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D1%81_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B0_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%96%80%E5%B1%B1%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E5%A7%86%E6%9E%97%E5%AE%AB"},{"name":"库尔沙里夫清真寺","orig":"Кол Шәриф мәчете","intro":"位于克里姆林宫内，2005年完工，以16世纪抵抗伊凡雷帝军队的鞑靼伊玛目命名。穹顶呈莲花形，祈祷大厅被大量窗户照亮。敏拜尔上有孔雀石立柱，上层穹顶内侧和窗玻璃刻有真主的九十九个尊名。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/%D0%91%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D1%8F_%D0%A1%D1%8E%D1%8E%D0%BC%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B5%2C_%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D1%81_%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.JPG/960px-%D0%91%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D1%8F_%D0%A1%D1%8E%D1%8E%D0%BC%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B5%2C_%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D1%81_%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%AB%E7%88%BE%E6%B2%99%E9%87%8C%E5%A4%AB%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"苏尤姆别卡塔","orig":"Сөембикә манарасы","intro":"克里姆林宫内一座倾斜的砖塔，以末代喀山汗国女王之名命名。关于其建造年代有多种说法，但塔本身已成为喀山的标志性轮廓。不向公众开放进入，从下方仰望可见其逐渐收窄的层叠结构。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Kazan_Soyembika.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1516},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%8F%E5%B0%A4%E5%A7%86%E5%88%AB%E5%8D%A1%E5%A1%94"},{"name":"报喜大教堂","orig":"Благовещенский собор","intro":"克里姆林宫内16世纪的沙俄风格大教堂，蓝色洋葱形穹顶与金色尖塔的搭配在伏尔加河对岸也能辨认。附带一个关于教堂的小型博物馆。进入克里姆林宫后沿中央大道向北即能到达其门前。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Kazan._Annunciation_Cathedral_P8111933_2575.jpg/960px-Kazan._Annunciation_Cathedral_P8111933_2575.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":null},{"name":"鲍曼街","orig":"улица Баумана","intro":"喀山主要的步行街，两侧是19世纪以来的商业建筑、商店与咖啡馆。街道从克里姆林宫方向延伸出去，串联起多个食堂与餐厅。沿街可以看到这座城市日常生活中俄语与鞑靼语并存的细节。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Baumana_Street_Kazan_Russia_2009_sept_06.jpg/960px-Baumana_Street_Kazan_Russia_2009_sept_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1434},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauman_Street%2C_Kazan"}],"foods":[{"name":"埃奇波奇马克","orig":"өчпочмак","intro":"鞑靼式三角形肉馅烤饼，传统上以羊肉或牛肉加洋葱和土豆为馅。在鲍曼街的Dom Chaya可以吃到现场烘制的版本，常配茶一起食用。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/Echpochmak-wiki.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":796},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Echpochmak"},{"name":"埃列什","orig":"элеш","intro":"一种鞑靼圆形馅饼，内馅多为禽肉或肉末。同样可以在Dom Chaya的柜台找到，属于价格低廉的日常食物。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"恰克恰克","orig":"чәкчәк","intro":"鞑靼传统甜点，用炸过的面团小块堆叠后浇上热蜂蜜糖浆。常出现在婚礼和节庆场合，也是喀山常见的伴手礼。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Chak-chak_shirinligi.jpg/960px-Chak-chak_shirinligi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chak-chak"},{"name":"马肉","orig":"ат ите","intro":"鞑靼烹饪中使用马肉，做法包括风干或入馅。Dom Chaya等餐厅以马肉制品为特色之一，可搭配面饼或作为冷盘食用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Paardenrookvlees.JPG/960px-Paardenrookvlees.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse_meat"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/%D0%94%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%86_%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%B22.jpg/1280px-%D0%94%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%86_%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%B22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Kazan_Kremlin._Spasskaya_Tower_P8111872_2200.jpg/1280px-Kazan_Kremlin._Spasskaya_Tower_P8111872_2200.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853}],"outline":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[48.8205846,55.8256932],[48.8324132,55.8242439],[48.8424295,55.8195264],[48.8411973,55.8163914],[48.8402439,55.807737],[48.8393352,55.790422],[48.8405491,55.7898835],[49.0151595,55.7906662],[49.076786,55.7570176],[48.9883715,55.693419],[48.9885063,55.6838208],[48.9914368,55.6738946],[49.0388886,55.6737989],[49.0601201,55.6800427],[49.0645775,55.6774575],[49.0708885,55.6816744],[49.0812479,55.6817129],[49.089151,55.683334],[49.0960061,55.6827877],[49.0967739,55.685401],[49.1062461,55.6845263],[49.1134127,55.6807945],[49.1113596,55.6798346],[49.1121886,55.6794085],[49.1088331,55.6788177],[49.1106382,55.6766301],[49.107262,55.6761193],[49.1074477,55.6754765],[49.111585,55.6753604],[49.1107294,55.6737436],[49.106112,55.6732331],[49.106454,55.6717561],[49.1127612,55.6730599],[49.1112524,55.6717379],[49.1140071,55.6709756],[49.1155118,55.6717977],[49.1138059,55.6722091],[49.1147554,55.6727234],[49.1157934,55.6719217],[49.1175315,55.6724057],[49.1166893,55.6734161],[49.1186084,55.6753271],[49.1224627,55.6770006],[49.1250564,55.6766558],[49.1222334,55.6714211],[49.1228852,55.6713091],[49.1452199,55.6775602],[49.1401184,55.6818642],[49.1373503,55.6814498],[49.1363499,55.6826233],[49.1395739,55.6846253],[49.1341183,55.6872139],[49.1338286,55.6912961],[49.1348223,55.6915149],[49.1420687,55.6868479],[49.1437809,55.6839827],[49.1482186,55.6799678],[49.1529125,55.6786884],[49.1520703,55.6752977],[49.1508847,55.6752447],[49.1558361,55.670518],[49.1598862,55.6704772],[49.1626811,55.6666304],[49.1624397,55.6639073],[49.189589,55.6776207],[49.1872555,55.6780048],[49.1873628,55.6794506],[49.1822398,55.6822392],[49.183951,55.6836515],[49.1820911,55.6855138],[49.1836707,55.6862154],[49.1835704,55.6869698],[49.1803717,55.6866266],[49.1804827,55.68895],[49.1785901,55.6886479]